<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results from</p>
<p>the Swiss indoor tennis championships on Saturday (prefix</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Hendrik Dreekman (Germany) beat Jiri Novak (Czech Republic 7-5</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) 7-6 (7-4) 6-3</p>
</text>
